<title>USA: Earthgrains Co Q4 March 25 profit vs loss.</title>
<headline>Earthgrains Co Q4 March 25 profit vs loss.</headline>
<dateline>ST. LOUIS, Mo. 1997-05-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>1997		     1996</p>
<p> Shr     profit	   $0.19     loss	 $0.86</p>
<p> Net     profit	   1,900     loss	 8,800</p>
<p> Revs		     387,600		  367,700</p>
<p> Avg shrs		  10,100		   10,200</p>
<p>(All Data Above 000s Except Per Share Numbers)</p>
<p>NOTE: Q4 1997 net profit includes $7.3 million after-tax restructuring charge and $5.3 million in one-time Spanish tax incentives and credits. Excluding items, Q4 1997 operating profit $3.9 million or $0.39 a share.  </p>
<p>Q4 1996 loss included $4.7 million after-tax non-recurring charges related primarily to legal settlement. Excluding charge, Q4 196 operating loss $4.1 million or $0.40 a share.</p>
<p>			YEAR</p>
<p> Shr     profit	   $1.60     loss	 $2.93</p>
<p> Net     profit	  16,200     loss	29,900</p>
<p> Revs		   1,662,600		1,660,500</p>
<p> Avg shrs		  10,100		   10,200</p>
<p>(All Data Above 000s Except Per Share Numbers)</p>
<p>NOTE: Full-year 1997 operating profit, excluding charge and tax credit, $18.8 million or $1.86 a share.</p>
<p>Excluding charge, year-ago fiscal year operating loss $18.3 million or $1.80 a share.</p>
<p>((Reuters Chicago Newsdesk (312) 408-8787))</p>
